window.products.push({"id":645060,"name":"18/8 Stainless Steel Measuring Cups and Spoons Set of 16 Pieces - 7 Nesting Cups and 7 Stackable Spoons - Durable Professional Portable Kitchen Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817U65SQiHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌟 PREMIUM QUALITY — While other measuring cups and spoons sets usually have weak fragile handles that bend & break quickly, TOHIN Last-Forever Handles are made as a one piece construction with super durable high-quality food-grade 18/8 stainless steel (304ss) with THICKNESS of 0.8mm, making the set one of the most durable. Built with stamina, professional modern cooking utensils and gadgets measuring cups and spoons set guarantee long life with no rusting or bending. ❤️ EASY TO READ MEASUREMENTS — Instead of printing labels that fade, our measurements are engraved & stamped right into the metal so they are permanent, easier to read and would never wear off. Each cup has outside markings for a smaller measurement size visible on the inside. It‘s time to get rid of your old plastic cup & spoon measure set where the writings rub off. Enjoy confident scooping and absolute precision with a measurement set that will not need replacement. 🎄 IDEAL LIFETIME SOLUTION — Refine the measurement to get a perfect taste with convenient and unique metal measuring cups and spoons kitchen set that will ensure no guesswork of adding spice to your dish. The highest quality & heavy duty 18/8 (304) stainless steel is super durable and easy to clean - just put the cups and spoons into the dishwasher. ☃️ COMPLETE SET OF 16 — Enjoy all sizes every kitchen needs! Others typically have 12 / 14 pieces in the set, while we OFFER 16 PCS. Our large stainless steel measuring cups and spoons set includes a 7 piece dry metal measuring cup set that has sizes from 1 cup down to an 8th cup (1 cup, ¾ cup, ⅔ cup, ½ cup, ⅓ cup, ¼ cup, ⅛ cup), + 7 metal measuring spoons from 1 tablespoon to an 8th teaspoon (1 Tbsp, ½ Tbsp, 1 tsp, ¾ tsp, ½ tsp, ¼ tsp and ⅛ tsp). The rest 2 PCS are 2 D Rings as a BONUS. 🎁 FUNCTIONAL & SAFE - Our stainless steel measure cup set is dishwasher safe. 7 Stackable metal measuring spoons and 7 cups are nested together, enabling you to compactly store them and easily take them out without cups being stuck. It is the best solution to plastic, silicone, copper, and silver measuring sets. These measuring spoons and cups with perfectly carved smooth edges will be your best assistant in cooking and baking. These kitchen measuring tools are a great present to whom you LOVE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817U65SQiHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOHIN","source_asin":"B0872HFZ2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0872HFZ2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0872HFZ2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
