window.products.push({"id":645161,"name":"CGOLDENWALL 150g Grain Grinder Mill Small Spice Grinder Electric 850W 28000r/min Fast Grinding Pulverizer Dry Grain Corn Spices Seasonings Wheat Gift ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712cZj2cABL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SMALL SIZE & SIMPLE OPERATION - Power: 850W; Speed: 28000r/min; Working time: No more than 3min; Interval Time:5-10 min; Capacity:150g *NOTE: 150g grinder is of relatively small volume, so the material recommended to grind one time must cover the long blade in the middle and NO MORE THAN 2/3 of the container. 1/2 of the container is the best. SUPERFINE GRAIN GRINDER - Three-layer stainless steel blades make pulverizing more easily and quickly. Normal grains only needs 30s to be ground finely. The final fineness can reach from 70 to 300 mesh. If you are not satisfied with the first grinding result, please try to multiple grinding rather than grind items for too long time at a time. APPLIED TO VARIOUS DRIED MATERIALS - Widely used for grinding ①grains (soy, corn, rice, wheat, mung beans, coffee beans), ②spices and seasonings (star anise, fennel, pepper, rosemary) ③herbs *NOTE: Due to its small volume and motor, 150g grinder is not very suitable for grinding panax notoginseng, pearls and other tough items. Please choose the mill with over 300g capacity (ASIN: B07P8F1Y7P) to smash large and hard items. UPGRADED DOUBLE SAFETY DESIGNS - ①When open the lid, the grinder will automatically stop, largely enhancing security and protecting the user from injury. ②When grain grinder is in an overloaded/overheat state, the overload protector will work automatically to stop the operation. CLEAN & MAINTENANCE - Just use a cleaning brush to clean up the jar and wipe the inside with dried cloth. The container is not detachable, so it cannot rinsed with water directly. The blades can be removed to clean with water but make sure they are dried before reinstallation. IMPORTANT ATTENTION - 1. Our grinder can only be turned on after the lid is fully buckled. Please follow the steps of How to Close Lid on manual, video or listing image 5. 2. The materials ready for grinding must be DRY enough. 3. Rest the machine for 5-10 minutes after every 3 minutes operation. We will provide you with the best products and services. If there is anything we can help with,warmly welcome to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712cZj2cABL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CGOLDENWALL","source_asin":"B00PQHLF38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PQHLF38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PQHLF38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
