window.products.push({"id":645208,"name":"Over The Sink Dish Drying Rack, Stainless Steel Over Sink Dish Drying Rack Height (1-21.8'') & Length (23.7-33.5'') Adjustable for Dishes and Utensils","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KMKblS7lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Adjustable Height & Length for your need: Unlike other dish rack, the height & length of Soraken over sink dish drying rack can be adjusted to perfect fit most of the kitchen sinks, simply adjust as you need. Our dish rack size is 23.7-33.5(L) x 11.5 (W) x 21.8(H) inches. Note: The height of the faucet should be ≤ 21.8 inches, the length of the sink should be ≤ 33.5 inches, the height between the cabinet bottom to the countertop should be ≥ 25 inches. All-in-one to Save Your Sapce: The practical design of the over sink dish drying rack combines drying with kitchen storage in order to save your kitchen space. The over sink dish rack aims to improve kitchen space utilization by using the space above the sink. All your dishes and utensils are stored right on the dish rack after cleaning and the water will drip into the sink, keeping your countertop dry, clean, and tidy. Durable Quality Will Last for Years: The over the sink dish drying rack is made of high-grade aluminum alloy with baking finish surface, which gives the over sink dish rack unparalleled durability that will last for years, The black powder coating protects the dish rack from rust or corrosion. Engineered for maximum stability and with the bottom reinforcement L-shaped structure, the dish rack won’t topple over when loaded. Assemble Easily: Our over sink dish drying rack is equipped with a hex key and a wrench, no extra tools needed, easy to install. The hole positions are accurate and the steps are simple. In addition, all the screws required during the installation have been installed at the desired location, and you just need to tighten them with the hex wrench. Multi-Function Use: The over the sink dish drying rack has been divided into different parts reasonable for organizing everything well from pots and pans to dishes and bowls, cups, cutting boards, knives, and utensils. You can also Customize it further and you can set it up any way you like it. The set includes 1 dish rack, 1 detergent rack, 1 cutting board rack, 1 knife holder, 1 utensil holder, 4 hooks, and 1 hex wrench.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KMKblS7lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soraken","source_asin":"B08L79R642","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L79R642","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L79R642","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
