window.products.push({"id":645224,"name":"Glamper Alpaca Blanket by Alicia Adams Alpaca | Throws for Couch, Bed or Armchair Winter Blanket | 51 x 71 in. Light Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xj4y27vFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFT BLANKET Rustic meets refined in the Alicia Adams Alpaca Glamper Blanket. This eco-conscious alpaca blend blanket has been featured on The Today Show for years. It's exceptionally versatile and functions as a couch blanket, a car blanket or quite simply the softest blanket in the world! COZY BLANKET Our Glamper Blanket is considerably heavier than our traditional alpaca blankets and has a more rustic vibe and texture to the touch. This stunning, fair-trade made alpaca blanket incorporates a beautiful whipstitch trim that truly sets this product apart with a look you can't find anywhere else. HOLIDAY BLANKET GIFT As temperatures drop, nothing makes a better gift to friends and loved ones than a lavish, Alicia Adams Alpaca Glamper Blanket. The lush, cozy blanket is perfect for your favorite newlyweds, a housewarming gift, or even a luxe baby shower gift. Proudly fair-trade produced in Peru. ALPACA BENEFITS Alpaca wool, one of the world’s most luxurious fibers, is even softer than cashmere and is sustainably sourced. Its fibers are longer, and less likely to pill. It even traps and releases heat, since it’s a smart fiber. Blanket is 52% alpaca, 33% wool, 15% cotton - dry clean only. ALICIA ADAMS ALPACA is a family business which specializes in the design and eco-friendly production of textiles using one of the rarest and most luxurious materials - alpaca wool. With a background in fashion PR, Alicia adds an urban edge to her classic designs. Ease your carbon footprint with a sustainably sourced winter Blanket that keeps family and friends warm and cozy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xj4y27vFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alicia Adams Alpaca","source_asin":"B09LYMM1B2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LYMM1B2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LYMM1B2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
