window.products.push({"id":645246,"name":"Harbor House Camellia Full/Queen Duvet Set, Tan/Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515UsA2a5HL._AC_.jpg","description":"Bring beautiful blooms to the bedroom with the Camellia duvet set, part of Harbor House’s collection that boasts the casual style of a California coastal inn. A field of elegantly embroidered vines and blossoms adorn the duvet cover, which can be slipped over a comforter or used as its own lightweight layer in warmer seasons. The pillow shams repeat the embroidered design, and all pieces are neatly framed with an understated border stripe for added interest. Sewn from 100 percent cotton twill, the set includes a duvet and two pillow shams. Available in an assortment of colors, the duvet set combines easily with a wide range of sheet sets for decorative variety. Sized to fit a full or queen bed, the duvet measures 92 by 96 inches and the pillow shams measure 20 by 26 inches each. Imported.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515UsA2a5HL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Harbor House","source_asin":"B001ATMIKU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001ATMIKU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001ATMIKU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":645247,"name":"eeHAUS Custom Cut, (W 86 x H 64 (Inch), Green), Zebra Roller Shades, Dual Layer Blinds, Privacy Control, Sheer Shades, Light Filtering Day and Night","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":153.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7103kBnWDDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✔️【Zebra Roller Shade goes well with any place】 The fabric and mesh cross each other in a unique design to protect your privacy from outside and creates a comfy space by controlling the amount of light that enters the room. It's a design that goes well with any space, so you can install it in various places to create a neat and clean interior. You can use it in almost any place such as bedrooms, living rooms, kitchens, offices, or studios where you need a moderate amount of lighting. ✔️【EASY TO INSTALL】 Simple installation for women with a single screwdriver It's easy and simple for women to install with a Phillips head (+) screwdriver or an electric drill. It's not difficult at all. Now try installing it yourself. ✔️【The latest technology and a rich production experience】 Quick Absorption(Quickly absorbs harmful moisture), Fast Drying(Maintains comfort by quickly drying any moisture that was absorbed), UV Protection, Protection Against Dust. Using high-quality fabrics that are safe for the human body and high-quality, light aluminum materials and parts for easy installation and use. ✔️【Take care of the window】 The window area in a room is much larger than you think. Managing windows well can change not only the temperature and amount of sunlight but also the atmosphere of the whole room. The roller shade is a cost-effective choice that makes windows neat and tidy, pleasantly and comfortably changing the atmosphere of the room. ✔️Imported from S.Korea. If there are any changes after ordering, send us a Message within 6 hours of placing your order. After 6 hours, the factory considers the order to be confirmed and therefore cuts the fabric and manufactures the product. Once production is complete, we will send it to you quickly. However, please understand that in the event of bad traffic conditions and bad weather, the expected delivery date may change.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7103kBnWDDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"eeHAUS","source_asin":"B0912FH1MC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0912FH1MC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0912FH1MC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
