window.products.push({"id":645267,"name":"Air Purifiers for Home Large Rooms up to 1200ft², MOOKA H13 True HEPA Air Purifier for Bedroom Pets with Fragrance Sponge, Timer, Air Filter Cleaner f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hRWsXf+0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALL-IN-ONE AIR PURIFIER FOR HOME: This is MOOKA 2023 newly designed True HEPA Air Purifier, which contains all the functions of a powerful air purifier. The air purifier for home covers an area of up to 1200ft², not only equipped with an imported true H13 HEPA filter that can quickly catch peculiar odors, smoke, dust, pollen, and dander, but also with functions like Aromatherapy, 4-fan speed, sleep mode, child lock, timer, filter replacement indicator, and the optional night light. HIGH-PERFORMANCE H13 HEPA FILTER: Mooka AP-S0610L air purifier can effectively purify larger particles, up to 1200ft² coverage and refreshes a room of 300 ft² rapidly in just 10 minutes. Modern design fits in any space from small to large rooms, bedrooms, living rooms, offices, nurseries, kitchens and basements. Perfect for pet owners, babies, children, the elderly, or anyone wanting to improve the air quality. SLEEP WITH FRAGRANCE＆NIGHT LIGHT: Struggling with pet odors or musty smells? The AP-S0610L Air purifier equips with an essential oil sponge, you can add 4-5 drops of your favorite essential oils to the aroma pad of the air cleaners. The flow of the fresh air will effectively help you fall asleep, additionally, the night light is optional and you can set a timer (2H/4H/8H) accordingly, perfect for a quiet and soothing indoor environment. ULTRA-QUIET, ENERGY-SAVING & SAFE: Thanks to the new brushless motor, the 13dB noise level is almost voiceless. This HEPA air purifier cleans your air, doesn't disturb your work, study or sleep. Running in low power makes it extremely energy-saving. Child lock prevents error operations caused by pets or children. The replacement HEPA filter should be replaced every 3-6 months depending on the environment and usage frequency. (Search for B0BR5BJG4J on Amazon). QUALITY ASSURANCE & WORRY-FREE SERVICE: CARB/CE/FCC/RoHS/ETL/GS certified and ETL listed(Available for California). Our HEPA air purifier for the bedroom does not produce trace amounts of ozone, totally environment friendly. We provide our customers with a 1-year replacement warranty, please rest assured. If you have any questions about the Mooka air purifiers, please contact us directly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hRWsXf+0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOOKA","source_asin":"B0BXJMWFJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXJMWFJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXJMWFJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
