window.products.push({"id":645288,"name":"Zosar Meat Thermometer, Wireless BBQ Thermometer with 4 Probes for Grilling, Smoker, Oven and Kitchen, Cooking Thermometer with LCD Backlight and Cloc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YzkVWJ4vL._AC_SL1159_.jpg","description":"🍖【High Accuracy Reading】The temperature range: 0-250℃/32-482℉, accuracy of ±1°C(1.8°F). The reading speed of each probe is very fast, can read the data within 2-3 seconds. Wireless bbq thermometer can switch between Centigrade and Fahrenheit freely (PS: Please keep the two units in the same display mode before using). 🍖【Remote Transmission & No APP Required】Wireless Meat Thermometer with advanced technology provides a powerful and reliable connection up to 400 feet. There is no app required. The meat thermometer can pass through obstacles and walls, allowing the transmitter to measure the temperature accurately and transmit it to the receiver synchronously. 🍖【Alarm & Timer Function】The alarm function of meat thermometer can set your desired food of high/low temperature range, helps you know if your grill or smoker needs attention on temperature control. Its timer function allows you to step away from cooking without any worries of overcooking, there's no guessing when meat is getting done. 🍖【4 Probes & Large LCD Backlight】The bbq thermometer comes with 4 food grade stainless steel probes. It can monitor up to 4 different food at the same time. The receiver of digital meat thermometer has red LCD backlight for using at night or dim light conditions. The degrees appear on the screen immediately and effectively. 🍖【Convenient Design For Placement】Meat thermometers have built-in magnetic back, which can be adsorbed on the side of the smoker / oven / refrigerator or other unheated metal surface to save space when cooking. You can also open the rear bracket and place it on the table, so that you can check the temperature of the food during barbecue, baking, cooking， etc. Besides, 8 meat selection and 5 tastes settings, perfect for cooking beef, veal, chicken, pork, turkey, lamb, fish and hamburger.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YzkVWJ4vL._AC_SL1159_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zosar","source_asin":"B09JFLPRT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JFLPRT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JFLPRT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
