window.products.push({"id":645306,"name":"alikiki Medieval Flame Dragon Wine Goblet - Fantasy Dungeons and Dragons Wine Chalice - 7oz Stainless Steel Cup Drinking Vessel -Ideal Novelty Gothic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PMhHm54iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MEDIEVAL FLAME DRAGON GOBLET - This Wine cup is 6.8\" tall, Cup width 2.7in\" and can hold up to 7 ounces of your favorite beverage.Nice cups to use during gaming nights or a themed party. It will also be a great decor for your home as well as a functional wine goblet for your day to day use! Exquisite design - This flame fire dragon goblet is rich in details. The cup body is a mysterious deep purple base color, and the two sides of the dragon wings are flame bright yellow gradient colors, reflecting the powerful power of the dragon wings. Like a Gothic dragon flying in the dark. HIGH QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP - This Dragon Wine Goblet is made of fine resin and stainless steel lining ,Each piece is individually hand painted and polished, color tone may vary slightly from pictures, which gives it a unique look.The bottom is covered in felt so that it didn't scratch the table or anything. GREAT UNIQUE GIFT - Looking to buy an unusual present for your friends Lover or family? The magic dungeons and dragons goblet is the ideal choice for your friends, colleagues from office, or boss. You can even gift it at a wedding or housewarming party BACKED BY OUR 100% LOVE IT GUARANTEE. We expect the recipients of our dragon wine chalice to absolutely LOVE them. If for some reason they don’t, please return it for a no questions asked full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PMhHm54iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"alikiki","source_asin":"B093GXPMVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093GXPMVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093GXPMVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":645307,"name":"Queens Guard - Zardozi Embroidery - Christmas Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619+UGJbtqL._AC_SL1004_.jpg","description":"These unique Christmas decorations are made using the traditional method of zardozi embroidery. Zari (meaning gold) embroidery originated in Persia and reached India in the 12th century. It is a highly skilled embroidery technique that traditionally used gold wires and jewels to embellish courtly robes. Here those same techniques are used to great effect in producing fine Christmas ornaments. There are a limited number of such skilled artisans today who can create these challenging pieces.  Tinker Tailor under the leadership of the very talented designer Caroline Apfel has raised the bar on embroidered Christmas ornaments. Her aim is to make the most mesmerising hand made decorations and accessories in the world. She fuses together a luxury blend of culture and experiences from London to India. We are delighted to offer a collection of her fine ornaments featuring designs of British history and icons.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619+UGJbtqL._AC_SL1004_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tinker Tailor","source_asin":"B07TT7TJMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TT7TJMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TT7TJMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
