window.products.push({"id":645323,"name":"Beistle Convertible Photo Property, 3-Feet 10-Inch by 25-Inch, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q3NMp-2eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Pink Convertible Photo Prop is made of board stock. It measures 3 feet 1/2 inch by 25 Inch. Put this photo prop on a table and have the guests stand behind it to get their photos taken. It is a great item to use for a 50's or rock and roll party!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q3NMp-2eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beistle","source_asin":"B07C8GS3DL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C8GS3DL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C8GS3DL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":645324,"name":"Manual Woodworkers Izzy Collection Lil' BBQ Dude Kids 3-Piece Apron Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OXqKKFJdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer When you bring your kids into the kitchen you aren't just making treats, you are making memories to last a lifetime. Although Thomas Lemuel Oates started Manual Woodworkers & Weavers in 1932, the story goes back further. The roots of the company can be found in Oates' entrepreneurial spirit. He and his brother used to farm the mountain areas of Bat Cave in western North Carolina. They would also help their mother find materials for her crafts. The sons began to make wooden whistles, buckets and bird-houses. They would sell their wares along with her crafts to the people from Charlotte that came through in their horse-drawn buggies on the way to the mountains. Later, Thomas worked at the Ashville Postcard Company. When the Depression hit, he lost his job, but it inspired him to go into business and sell crafts, like cornhusk dolls and woven pieces, that were produced by the local women. He had learned about the wholesale business while working at Ashville. He built a waterwheel to generate electricity at a mill, began making product and opened shop. Over the years, he expanded the company. His son, Lemuel Oates, who would next manage the company, says he worked in the business from a young age. He explains the products were made from cotton scraps left over from making socks. Half-inch circles would be looped together to form a variety of products. Lemuel Oates went to college and then settled in Richmond. In December 1973, he returned to Bat Cave and took over the company. In 2007 his son Travis and his daughter, Molly Oates Sherrill, took over the business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OXqKKFJdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Manual Woodworkers","source_asin":"B006S2ZYYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006S2ZYYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006S2ZYYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":645325,"name":"Daxi Events 1200 Pieces Separated Artificial Rose Petals, Fake Non-Woven Fabrics Flower Petals for Romantic Night, Wedding, Party, Events, Valentine D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VrSWdFXbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Daxi Events fabric rose petals are made of high-quality nonwoven fabrics，the 30% extra thickness non-woven material than the traditional silk fabric gives them a better realistic look and feel. The unique manufacturing process ensures our petals no smell, lightweight, high color fastness, and no burrs These yellow petals are pre-separated and loose in the bag, no need to spend hours pulling thousands of petals apart. Good for last-minute usage, sweet day gifts for her or him These fake flower petals work great for a romantic night, wedding decorations, party, special days, Valentine's Day, marriage proposals, table scatters, aisle runner scatters, or any occasion you want to emphasize romantic The artificial Petals measure about 2\" to 2 \" in diameter, similar in size to real rose petals. Each bag contains approximately 1200 Nonwoven petals cover about 42 square feet if spread evenly, which are sufficient in most lovers' romantic times. Feel free to buy more to use in larger events These nonwoven rose petals are an affordable and easy way to add romantics. The artificial petals can be used time and time again. Refund or Replacement is available, Daxi Events will always be there for you Because it is a pre-separated version, the petals may have a little wrinkle during transportation, and it can be restored to its shape by spreading it out for about 2 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VrSWdFXbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Daxi Events","source_asin":"B096Q87PXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096Q87PXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096Q87PXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":645326,"name":"Light Purple Wedding Aisle Runner 2.5FTx15FT Aisle Runner for Wedding Ceremony Velvet Fabric Carpet Runner for Party Wedding Floor Runner Outside for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y1STVz2rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★【Wedding Aisle Runner Size Information】You will receive 1PC velvet lavender aisle runner measures 30inches (75cm) wide x 15FT (450cm) long and 1 pack carpet tape. Whenever it comes to adding extra romantic and elegant to your wedding party, you can never go wrong with aisle floor runner. ★【Aisle Runner for Wedding Ceremony Material】Aisle runner rug are made of premium velvet fabric polyester material, rich color and soft touch, wrinke-free and durable ,delicate edges and stitches, which are idea decorations for wedding ceremony and other events. High quality aisle carpet runner creates an inviting ambiance for your guests. ★【Aisle Decorations】This aisle rug little slippery due to the soft luxury velvet material. This carpet runner for wedding is equipped with double-sided tape to help secure the aisle runner in place on the floor. You can use heavy items, nails or magic tapes to fix this party walkway.Also easy to remove and reuse, birthday aisle runner comes neatly folded in a package that takes up little to no space. ★【Wide Application of Carpet Runner for Party】Aisle runners great for wedding ceremony, party, bridal shower, baby shower, reception, prom, banquet, celebration, graduation, exhibition, birthday, beach, church and events decorations. Aslo, this bride aisle runner can be used for wedding arch drapes, wedding backdrop, party table runner and so on. This outdoor aisle runner sets a loving and elegant tone for your wedding ceremony. ★【Easy Care of Carpet Rug】This ceremony aisle runner can be washed by hand and machine with cold water. Do not bleaching. High quality ensures our prom aisle runner can be reuseable many times. Customer satisfaction is our first priority!! We will provide 24 hours of customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y1STVz2rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FANPROMS","source_asin":"B09XB3X5PL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XB3X5PL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XB3X5PL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
