window.products.push({"id":645410,"name":"5Pcs Absinthe Spoon Stainless Steel Bartender Cocktail Bar Utensils Wormwood Spoon (#1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.13,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Gg5+U72RL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Specification:Description: This item is made of high quality 304 stainless steel material, anti-rust and corrosion-resistant, durable and study to use. The wormwood spoon is by far our most desired spoon and also one of the most popular spoons by collectors of antique absinthe ware, mainly used in the preparation of a traditional French or absinthe. Nice product at good price, worth buying!Features: Made of high quality 304 stainless steel material, anti-rust and corrosion-resistant, durable to use and easy to clean. The good workmanship of excellent design that can be used as an antique absinthe ware collected by collectors. Great for bar Absinthe usage and it\\'s used by different country with different methods. Special used to prepare Absinthe in the traditional way of the 19th century. Placing the spoon on the of the glass, putting the sugar on top and slowly drip cold water to dissolve the change of . We have various beautiful designs for you to choose.Specification: Condition: 100% New Brand Color: Shown as picture Material: 304 Stainless Steel Designs: #1, #2, #3, #4, #5 #1 Size (L x W): Approx. 16 x 4cm / 6.3 x 1.6inch#2 Size (L x W): Approx. 16.3 x 3.6cm / 6.4 x 1.4inch#3 Size (L x W): Approx. 9.5 x 7.5cm / 3.7 x 3.0inch #4 Size (L x W): Approx.16.3 x 4.1cm / 6.4 x 1.6inch #5 Size (L x W): Approx. 16 x 4cm / 6.3 x 1.6inch Package Weight: Approx. 15-25gPackage Included: 1 x Wormwood SpoonNote: 1.French drinking method: It will be about 1 ounces of Absinth pour wine glass, flatting on a hollow at the cup mouth of the Absinth spoon, and putting a lump of sugar in the spoon that from above the water drip irrigation with ice . When the ice water is injected into the Absinth, milky white clouds began to rise in the cup at the top. After injection water by Absinth spoon stirring, adding two or three pieces of ice. 2.Czech drinking method: First start the ignition in the gypsy area. Firstly, Absinth into the glasses, sugar teaspoon, immersed in a small amount of Absinth, later will make its burning brown sugar light caramel. You will dissolve the sugar into Absinth stirring, adding proper amount of drinking water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Gg5+U72RL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aramox","source_asin":"B07DFJGNDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DFJGNDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DFJGNDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
