window.products.push({"id":645531,"name":"JAXSUNNY White Nightstands Set of 2, Bedside Table Accent End Table w/ 2 Drawers, Night Stand for Bedroom, 28 Inch Tall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HthQqUNrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【The Nightstands to Give Security】Feel pinched in pocketbooks and insecure about futures? It is time to gain more assurances inside towards your daily life. No matter when you turn over in the night to reach your phone, or forget to get your belongings the last minute rushing out, the 2-drawer nightstands kill two birds with one stone as an economical solution. Here it is, a solid yet modern end table greatly eliminates the uncertainty and enhances the flexibility in an orderly fashion. 【Strong Structure Achieves Stability】Distinct from the wobbly side table that requires heavy items putting at the bottom or the flimsy end table that should be handled with care to avoid heavy weights, the night stands are constructed of splay wood legs and durable MDF frame which assures strong stability. It’s a decently sturdy nightstand with relatively light weight, which work out well in terms of capacity, function and height. 【Slide the Drawer Smoothly】Inside the drawer are the glide rails built to ensure a smooth slide no matter when you pull it out or push it back, which enables you to reach several inches down and get whatever you want while the anti-slip plastic stopper effectively prevents the drawers from falling out when moving around, making it such a motivation to go on a neat feast. Sleek and modern, the white end table add a nice touch of elegance. 【Attentive Design in Details】You won’t stand a chance of being upset about the cheap metal knob the nightstands come with, nor need you struggle to select a suitable one to go for your home decors. The bedroom night stand is designed with a groove handle which does not compromise the integrity of aesthetic. The foot pads are also attached to level the uneven floor and protect from any easy scratches. 【Utility Table with Capacious Storage】Find and access to versatility with the bedside furniture as it can be easily reconfigured as nightstand in the bedroom, end table in the guest room, sofa table in the living room or side table at the entryway. The table top is wide enough to accommodate lamp, phone, glasses, night guard, books or candle holder while the two drawers slide in and out extremely smooth to keep clutter away. 【Simplistic in Assembly】Don’t bother with something asking for complicated installation steps along with a large number of screws that cannot tell the difference. You could save your drinks after the assembly since our bedside tables with 2 drawers are easy to put together. Instructions are easy to follow and parts are all labeled. The table top and two drawers hold a large weight capacity which is 66 lbs and 44 lbs severally, where sufficient storage spaces are granted.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HthQqUNrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JAXSUNNY","source_asin":"B07ZYY2DD1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZYY2DD1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZYY2DD1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
