window.products.push({"id":645624,"name":"Knife Sharpener,Kitchen Knife Sharpener - 3-Stage Knife Sharpening Tool Helps Repair, Restore and Polish Blades","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519X9cefQnL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Professional sharpener for super sharp edges on your 15 and 20-degree class knives..3-Step Knife Sharpening System: With our incredible 3-slot system, we’re revolutionizing the art of knife sharpening! The 1st diamond sharpening rod repairs and straightens damaged blades before the 2nd slot sharpens to restore its V-shape. Finally, the 3rd slot fine tunes for a clean polish. Easy to Use: Whether you’re right or left-handed, the ergonomic handle allows you to restore your cooking knives in a matter of seconds! Simply place the blade in each of the slots and gently pull the knife through a few times for fast, effective sharpening. Designed with a non-slip base, our kitchen knife sharpener offers comfortable control while you work. Use to quickly sharpen your damaged and dull knives and for everyday knife maintenance. This gem sharpens damaged and dull knives with just a few pulls through the coarse slot. This slot includes carbide blades at preset angles to quickly bring a dull knife back to life. Then quickly finish and polishes the knife edge with just a few pulls through the fine slot. Premium Quality: With our professional knife sharpener kit, you don’t have to be a chef to cook like one! Crafted from solid ABS plastic, it’s strong, durable and designed to last a lifetime. Made with high quality materials, knives will work like new. Shop Risk Free: We’re so confident that you’ll love our knife sharpening kit, we’re backing each order with our unconditional money back guarantee! If you are not completely satisfied, simply return the product within 30 days and we’ll refund your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519X9cefQnL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DLY","source_asin":"B0798SLKNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0798SLKNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0798SLKNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":645625,"name":"JOFLY Washable & Cushioned Kitchen Mats 2 PCS, Anti Slip & Fatigue Floor Rugs for Home, Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y+A0Tf0TL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"✔Environmental-friendly material & safe: the kitchen rugs and mats are firmly woven with polyester on top that is soft and comfortable to step on and natural rubber underneath, which is non-slip with the rubber creating friction with the floor. ✔2 Pieces: 2-piece rugs for kitchen are included. Thickness: 0.24 inch. Size: 17x48 and 17x24 inch, suitable for different spaces. ✔Easy to clean: the floor mats with waterproof surface can be easily cleaned. Simply wipe dirt off with a damp cloth or use a hand-held vacuum as needed. You can also throw it into a washing machine and let the machine do the work. ✔Multiple occations: The rubber floor mats, with comfort foam, can be used in kitchen, laundry rooms, door entrances, patio and more. ✔Buy now with no risk: high quality office/kitchen/bathroom rugs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y+A0Tf0TL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOFLY","source_asin":"B08K8ZVZP7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K8ZVZP7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K8ZVZP7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
