window.products.push({"id":645668,"name":"Space Heater-1500W Electric Heater With 3 Heating Modes,Tip-Over& Overheat Protection, Portable Heater with 4 Wheels, Adjustable Thermostat, Remote Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QtxFsghtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3 Power Modes & Fast Heating】- Air Choice Space infrared heater adopts 3 heat settings. The High mode can reach to 1500W, which will warm your whole living room just in seconds. The low mode of space heater delivers 750W of warm airflow, design for office or smaller room. The ECO mode will save you a lot of heating bills when the room heater keeping on all night long in your bedroom. 【Safety Assurance of Space Heater】- Go out but forgot to turn off the heater? Don’t worry, overheat protection will be automatically shut off when the heater is overheated. If the product is accidentally knocked over by your pets, the Tip-over feature can help also help it to automatically close. Besides, you can set a child lock to prevent your kids from being injured operating the heater by themselves 【Adjustable Thermostat& Smart 12Hrs Timer】- With easy to read LED temperature settings you can select temperatures from 59°F to 86°F or select max heat for maximum warmth. Air Choice space heater can be also programmed from 1 hour to 12 hours. Once the timer is set the heater will automatically shut off after the programmed time 【Remote Control & Portable with 4 Wheels】- Air Choice space heater is equipped with a remoter control and LED display screen. All the functions can be set by the remote control. You can adjust the space heater with the remote when you are lying on the bed or watching TV on the couch. 4 360°wheels allows you to easily move the heater from the living room to bedroom. 11*10*14.9 inches dimension is suitable for various spaces 【Low Noise & Quality Assurance 】- Heat up your room in seconds. The sound it causes will not disturb resting. Air choice space heater for indoor use promises you 2-Year quality assurance. The customer service team will prove you with a satisfying service within 12Hrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QtxFsghtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Air Choice","source_asin":"B07VM9PPDH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VM9PPDH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VM9PPDH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
