window.products.push({"id":645909,"name":"DICTAC RGB Gaming Chairs LED Office Chair Computer Gaming Chair Recliner Racing Style with Neck and Lumbar Pillows High Back Capacity 400lbs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CVI87lxYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏍[RGB] The gaming chair has the coolest features. RGB light bars and USB ports are embedded around the seat. 7 lights can be obtained by plugging in the power supply. The seven lights can be replaced in turn according to your preferences, and the brightness can be adjusted. The light flow speed can be adjusted. Bring you a unique sense of atmosphere when gaming 🏍[Professional design] The gaming chair adopts a special racing chair design, which is ergonomic, and brings you an immersive feeling in the game. The seat and backrest are designed with double wings to bring you a sense of security in the game. 🏍[Backrest can be adjusted 170°] The backrest can be adjusted from 90° to 170°. 90° is suitable for work or games, and 120° can relax your body and enjoy mobile games at ease. 170° can completely relax your body and give you the experience of a bed. The chair has a neck pillow and lumbar support, even if you lie flat, you don’t need a pillow. 🏍[Ergonomics] This gaming chair has a waist back and a neck pillow to design the height and width according to the body curve to create the most comfortable mouth. The backrest is very suitable for the neck, back and waist curves. Reduce the pressure on the hips and back, relax the body, even if you sit for a long time, you will not feel tired. The seat can be tilted to a certain angle and locked, which will make you feel more relaxed. 🏍[High safety] The gas rod used to adjust the height of the chair is explosion-proof and has passed SGS certification. It is safe to use and can bear a weight of 400lbs. 🏍[Removable handrail]: The handrail can be detached. If you don’t like being surrounded by armrests, you can remove the armrests. This gaming chair is not only suitable for games, but also suitable for offices, computer rooms and workplaces","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CVI87lxYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DICTAC","source_asin":"B08RY3R1MH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RY3R1MH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RY3R1MH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
