window.products.push({"id":645918,"name":"Gooseneck Kettle for Coffee and Tea - Pour Over Kettle with Thermometer used on induction cooker or stove top for Coffee and Tea (850 ml, Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ls6TTV39L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ GOOSENECK SPOUT - Add beauty and functionality to your kitchen with this pour-over coffee kettle that features an elegant gooseneck spout. By increasing control over the speed and placement of the water, you can create barista-level craft coffee or tea. The balanced water saturation leads to better extraction and better taste! ✅ BUILT-IN COFFEE THERMOMETER - Say goodbye to burnt coffee and under-brewed tea. This cute tea kettle is a one-stop-shop. The built-in thermometer in the lid is color-coded so it’s easy to find the right temperature for that perfect cup. ✅ WELL-DESIGNED AND DURABLE - This drip kettle features a long, comfortable handle that’s far enough away from the base to avoid overheating, and the lid is airtight so nothing will spill over! Crafted with rust-free, surgical-grade stainless steel, it will last you a lifetime. ✅ SAFE FOR ALMOST ALL STOVETOPS - Whatever kind of stove you have in your kitchen, our dishwasher-safe stovetop kettle can work with. It’s safe for almost all stovetops including ceramic, halogen, gas and electric ranges","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ls6TTV39L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KT THERMO","source_asin":"B08779M46V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08779M46V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08779M46V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":645919,"name":"Fufengz Thick Chenille Non Slip Bathroom Rugs and mats Sets 3 Piece Bath mats for Bathroom Extra Soft and Absorbent Washable Toilet Rug Bathroom Runne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yT1poUbbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Additional mesh non-slip mats are provided】which doubles the non-slip resistance. With our additional mesh non-slip mats, the mats can be more firmly fixed in place. The mesh anti-slip mat is an extra gift from us. The floor mat itself is SBE/hot melt spray backing and can be used alone. The anti-skid effect will be even better after adding the additional mesh anti-skid pad that we give away. So you can choose to use the floor mat alone or use it with the free mesh non-slip mat 【Luxurious 3-piece bathroom carpet】includes 1 large 20\"x32\" bathrobe, 1 U-shaped contour rug 20\"x20\", and 1 small 16\"x24\" bathrobe. The Fufengz bathroom carpet set is made of 100% luxurious chenille fabric microfiber, which has a higher pile than other products. Thick and soft chenille helps soothe tired feet and keep your toes warm on the cold floor. The high density and plush of chenille provide excellent comfort and support for your feet. 【Excellent water absorption】Our mat is very suitable for bathrooms with heavy traffic because it will dry out quickly. Super soft bathroom mats have more than 10,0000 fibers per square inch, which can absorb moisture faster and better. When you get out of the bathtub, jacuzzi, shower or sink, the thick woolen chenille on the top surface of the luxurious floor mat can absorb a lot of water and keep the floor dry, preventing dripping water from disturbing the cleanliness of the bathroom. 【Machine washable】 Just machine wash in cold water with mild detergent, then dry at low temperature. Do not iron or bleach. After dozens of machine wash tests, our bathroom carpets still look as good as new ones. Don't worry about it losing fibers, it's really easy to handle and maintain. Very durable material, no matter how many times it is washed and dried, the color will remain beautiful and vibrant for years to come. 【Very versatile】Put these carpets in front of the sink and near the bathtub/shower, standing on these soft and comfortable mats, doing hair/makeup, brushing your teeth, and drying yourself or your children, it feels better than standing on a hard, cold floor. You can also put it anywhere in the home, such as bedroom, living room, balcony, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yT1poUbbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fufengz","source_asin":"B09B41CZBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-645919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B41CZBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B41CZBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
